# Focused regression: create a GM Drum track, then return to the matrix.
# Same creation prefix as drum-create-edit; no unrelated lane/step edits.
# Known failure before correction: NotificationQueue overflows on validation.
0 scenario bench-macro-v1
100 transport start
200 button LEFT_TOP down
400 encoder_value NAV 0.010
600 button LEFT_TOP up
1000 assert_mode sequencer.clip_launcher
1200 encoder_value NAV 0.010
1400 encoder_value OPT -0.010
1600 encoder_value NAV 0.010
1800 encoder_value NAV 0.010
2200 tap NAV 60
2800 encoder_value NAV 0.010
3200 tap NAV 60
3800 encoder_value NAV 0.010
4200 tap NAV 60
4800 assert_mode sequencer.pattern
5000 tap LEFT_TOP 60
5500 assert_mode sequencer.clip_launcher
6000 transport stop
